---
Add items to existing pages
[BlacksmithShop2]
AddItem1=ItemID, ...
The number 1 in AddItem1 indicates the page number
Allows setting the item level using the ItemID+Lv form, example:
[BlacksmithShop2]
AddItem1=1502+2
Indicates the addition of Lumber Lv2 to the Blacksmith Ore Shop
---
Replace existing items
[BlacksmithShop2]
ReplaceItem1=OldItemID=NewItemID, ...
The number 1 in ReplaceItem1 indicates the page number
Allow setting new item levels using the NewItemID+Lv form, example:
[BlacksmithShop2]
ReplaceItem1=2152=2171+6
Replace Iron with Tenfold Steel Lv6 on page 1 of the Blacksmith Shop Ore Shop
---
Remove Existing Items
[BlacksmithShop2]
RemoveItem1=ItemID, ...
The number 1 in RemoveItem1 indicates the page number
example:
[BlacksmithShop2]
RemoveItem1=2152
Remove Iron item from Blacksmith Shop Ore Shop
---
Add new page
[BlacksmithShop2]
NewPageName1=Title
NewPage1=ItemID, ...
The number 1 in NewPageName1 and NewPage1 indicates the order of the pages appended to the end
NewPageName1 can only use the text predefined by UITextDic.DICID, other text will be displayed blank
Allows setting the item level using the ItemID+Lv form, example:
[BlacksmithShop2]
NewPageName1=SHOPCAT_Blacksmith_Stone_00
NewPage1=1502+4
Indicates the addition of Lumber Lv4 to the Blacksmith Ore Shop
Add a new page to the Blacksmith Shop Ore Shop, containing Lumber Lv5
